# OPERATOR STATE. `make pi-ship` does not overwrite the copy on the
# Pi (PI_OWNED in the Makefile). The version in git is only the seed
# for a fresh install, and it will drift from the running one.
# Edit it on the Pi (`sudo pf tui`, House lists, a/d), then apply.
#
# House-segment-only sinkhole additions (docs/house_gateway.md). One
# name per line. Subdomains are also blocked. This list is merged with
# house_default.domains and the feeds marked "segment": "house" in
# sources.json, minus house_never_block.domains. It never applies to the
# agent segment. The shipped defaults are in house_default.domains. To
# un-block one, add its name to house_never_block.domains, not here.
